<view class="page entry-page">
  <view class="eyebrow">开开华彩 · 活动回忆</view>
  <view class="title">活动相册工作台</view>
  <view class="muted entry-lead">主办方使用原 H5 账号登录，创建活动、上传素材并直接分享小程序相册卡片。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在检查登录状态…</view>
  <view wx:else class="card entry-card">
    <view class="entry-card-title">我是活动主办方</view>
    <button class="button button-primary entry-open" bindtap="onLogin">账号登录 · 进入工作台</button>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="entry-error">{{error}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="notice entry-notice">客户收到分享卡片后直接进入对应相册，查看与保存无需登录，也不需要复制网页链接。</view>
</view>
